WEBVTT

00:30.875 --> 00:34.425
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.445 --> 00:37.825
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.095 --> 00:44.065
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.225 --> 00:48.855
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.875 --> 00:52.385
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.405 --> 00:55.895
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.915 --> 00:59.425
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.445 --> 01:05.505
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.765 --> 01:23.045
Si Jin

01:23.065 --> 01:27.565
Episode 8

01:28.065 --> 01:30.015
Years ago, a fortune-teller

01:30.035 --> 01:31.605
once declared me ill-fated,

01:31.625 --> 01:33.675
destined to bring calamity upon my family.

01:35.115 --> 01:37.785
Fearing implication and loss of favor,

01:38.365 --> 01:40.425
she devised a scheme

01:40.445 --> 01:41.805
to convince my father

01:41.825 --> 01:43.295
to send me away,

01:43.315 --> 01:44.755
just like that.

01:44.975 --> 01:45.885
(In the past, )

01:45.905 --> 01:47.735
(he seldom spoke of his past.)

01:47.755 --> 01:49.785
(All I knew was his kin's disdain)

01:49.785 --> 01:51.295
(that exiled him to guard the borders.)

01:51.315 --> 01:52.455
(I never imagined)

01:52.475 --> 01:54.575
(he shared a fate similar to mine, )

01:54.595 --> 01:55.525
(branded an ill omen)

01:55.545 --> 01:57.345
(from our birth.)

01:57.365 --> 01:58.425
But what if that fortune-teller

01:58.425 --> 01:59.775
was a fraud,

01:59.795 --> 02:01.265
spouting doom just to

02:01.265 --> 02:02.785
seek fame and fortune?

02:03.545 --> 02:05.345
So what if he's a fraud?

02:05.745 --> 02:07.025
There's no point

02:07.025 --> 02:08.665
in digging deeper now.

02:09.865 --> 02:11.475
Ultimately,

02:11.585 --> 02:13.125
the decision

02:13.145 --> 02:15.225
lies with our parents.

02:16.515 --> 02:17.895
You think it's pointless,

02:17.915 --> 02:19.005
but I think

02:19.025 --> 02:20.895
it is necessary.

02:20.915 --> 02:22.115
If the vulnerable

02:22.115 --> 02:22.915
are saddled

02:22.915 --> 02:23.955
with all sorts of false charges

02:23.955 --> 02:25.445
by people in the world

02:25.465 --> 02:26.465
without question

02:26.465 --> 02:27.935
or resistance,

02:27.955 --> 02:28.955
doesn't that

02:28.955 --> 02:30.525
validate the wicked's lies

02:30.545 --> 02:32.435
and make themselves accomplices?

02:32.635 --> 02:35.035
If you were

02:36.325 --> 02:38.005
falsely accused,

02:38.485 --> 02:40.285
would you seek justice?

02:42.525 --> 02:44.325
If it were me,

02:46.325 --> 02:48.325
I would make

02:49.605 --> 02:50.965
the accuser pay.

02:52.045 --> 02:53.385
Mr. Yu,

02:53.405 --> 02:55.005
after all these years,

02:55.805 --> 02:57.725
don't you want to know the truth?

02:57.925 --> 02:59.365
One Capital Security Office,

02:59.365 --> 03:01.525
two people giving me a headache.

03:05.165 --> 03:07.945
But who reported the buried bodies

03:07.965 --> 03:09.585
at the Marquis's Mansion?

03:09.605 --> 03:10.625
It was the fourth daughter

03:10.645 --> 03:12.745
of Earl Dongping's household,

03:12.765 --> 03:14.125
Jiang Si.

03:14.205 --> 03:15.285
Cao Xingyu

03:15.305 --> 03:16.845
is her second sister's husband.

03:18.245 --> 03:18.865
That day,

03:18.865 --> 03:20.165
the second daughter of the Jiang Family

03:20.165 --> 03:21.605
invited her sisters to

03:21.605 --> 03:23.065
the Marquis's Mansion.

03:23.085 --> 03:25.505
Late that night, Jiang Si, sleepless,

03:25.525 --> 03:27.045
went to the garden

03:27.085 --> 03:29.725
and stumbled upon servants burying a body.

03:29.805 --> 03:30.805
She reported it

03:30.805 --> 03:32.325
to the Capital Security.

03:32.925 --> 03:34.025
But later,

03:34.045 --> 03:36.225
Cao Xingyu, the villain, struck first,

03:36.245 --> 03:37.385
accusing his wife

03:37.405 --> 03:38.925
of ordering the killing.

03:38.925 --> 03:39.905
Jiang Si

03:39.925 --> 03:41.565
then came forward to testify.

03:41.645 --> 03:44.005
Jiang Si

03:45.805 --> 03:47.345
is no ordinary soul,

03:47.365 --> 03:49.525
daring to cross Marquis Changxing.

03:49.805 --> 03:51.785
Each bolder than the last,

03:51.805 --> 03:54.005
none of them are ordinary.

03:55.245 --> 03:56.305
Thank...

03:56.325 --> 03:57.865
Thank you, Your Majesty.

03:57.885 --> 04:00.525
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

04:00.525 --> 04:01.885
Your Highness,

04:01.925 --> 04:03.165
the Speed Guards

04:03.165 --> 04:04.285
have mentioned Cao Xingyu

04:04.285 --> 04:06.445
for collaborating with Nanwu.

04:06.965 --> 04:07.905
Luckily,

04:07.925 --> 04:09.625
His Majesty didn't bring it up this time.

04:09.645 --> 04:10.945
So

04:10.965 --> 04:12.685
I guess it's over.

04:16.725 --> 04:18.385
My brother's mind

04:18.405 --> 04:19.905
is a labyrinth of thoughts.

04:19.925 --> 04:21.925
He keeps everything bottled up,

04:21.925 --> 04:24.045
which will only lead to disaster.

04:25.045 --> 04:26.405
Your Majesty,

04:30.045 --> 04:31.165
I have seized all documents

04:31.165 --> 04:32.505
related to the Surreal Wander

04:32.525 --> 04:34.205
(Two bottles of Surreal Wander)
and Nanwu

04:34.205 --> 04:35.805
from Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

04:36.845 --> 04:38.245
Put them away.

04:38.965 --> 04:40.365
Don't mention it again.

04:41.405 --> 04:43.585
Your Majesty, knowing well something's wrong,

04:43.605 --> 04:45.485
you set it aside for now.

04:46.165 --> 04:47.585
What is your intention behind this?

04:47.605 --> 04:49.845
Nanwu spies seep through every crack,

04:49.845 --> 04:51.085
their infiltration so deep

04:51.085 --> 04:52.805
it chills the bone.

04:53.845 --> 04:54.965
They'll inevitably scheme

04:54.965 --> 04:57.245
to ensnare the pillars of our court.

04:57.805 --> 04:59.605
We have to be on our guard.

05:00.045 --> 05:02.845
The Crown Prince is here!

05:06.925 --> 05:09.685
Your son kneels in contrition, Father.

05:10.485 --> 05:12.805
Prince Qi is here!

05:16.365 --> 05:18.525
Your son kneels in contrition, Father.

05:18.525 --> 05:21.925
The 1st and 3rd Princes are here!

05:22.725 --> 05:25.125
The 5th Prince is here!

05:25.165 --> 05:28.485
The 6th and 8th Princes are here!

05:30.845 --> 05:34.245
Your sons kneel in contrition, Father.

05:35.205 --> 05:36.525
Why did you come so late

05:36.525 --> 05:38.285
to kneel in contrition?

05:38.965 --> 05:42.045
(Yu Lang, Crown Prince)
Father, though I had

05:42.045 --> 05:44.165
a few encounters with Marquis Changxing's,

05:44.165 --> 05:45.505
no, Cao Xingyu, the criminal,

05:45.525 --> 05:47.585
our acquaintance was merely superficial.

05:47.605 --> 05:48.945
I truly had no knowledge

05:48.965 --> 05:50.825
of his murderous deeds.

05:50.845 --> 05:52.825
Father, Marquis Changxing has been

05:52.845 --> 05:54.925
(Yu Zhang, Prince Qi)
at odds with me,

05:54.965 --> 05:56.525
but Ling'an hasn't witnessed

05:56.525 --> 05:59.365
such a heinous murder in decades.

05:59.405 --> 06:01.025
Your personal trial of Cao Xingyu

06:01.045 --> 06:02.945
has been universally praised by the people.

06:02.965 --> 06:04.705
Father is wise.

06:04.725 --> 06:07.285
Father is wise.

06:09.165 --> 06:10.285
Turns out you're all here

06:10.285 --> 06:12.445
for Cao Xingyu's case.

06:14.925 --> 06:16.045
All right, all rise.

06:16.045 --> 06:17.925
Thank you, Father.

06:23.725 --> 06:25.385
Since you're all here,

06:25.405 --> 06:27.245
I'd like to ask you

06:27.605 --> 06:29.025
if you think

06:29.045 --> 06:30.365
I'm usually

06:30.365 --> 06:32.285
too strict with you.

06:39.645 --> 06:41.165
Yu Lang, you tell me.

06:42.645 --> 06:43.585
Father,

06:43.605 --> 06:44.845
your strictness towards me

06:44.845 --> 06:46.265
is for my own good

06:46.285 --> 06:47.945
and to secure the realm's future.

06:47.965 --> 06:50.925
So you think I'm strict?

06:51.045 --> 06:52.385
No, no.

06:52.405 --> 06:54.805
No, you're not.

06:55.965 --> 06:57.685
You're so scared.

06:58.365 --> 06:59.725
Yu Zhang, you tell me.

07:00.045 --> 07:01.405
Father,

07:01.485 --> 07:02.845
as princes

07:02.845 --> 07:04.145
supported by the people,

07:04.165 --> 07:05.925
we must be strict with ourselves.

07:06.725 --> 07:08.725
All right. Stop.

07:09.365 --> 07:11.125
You're not answering the question.

07:12.165 --> 07:14.705
I have eight sons and six daughters.

07:14.725 --> 07:16.605
With busy government affairs,

07:17.085 --> 07:19.525
I don't have much energy

07:19.525 --> 07:21.905
to teach most of you.

07:21.925 --> 07:23.285
Of course,

07:23.525 --> 07:26.025
Yu Lang is the crown prince.

07:26.045 --> 07:28.505
I'm naturally more strict with him.

07:28.525 --> 07:29.365
If you have

07:29.365 --> 07:30.605
anything to say,

07:30.605 --> 07:33.125
speak freely tonight.

07:33.405 --> 07:35.365
Don't hold it back.

07:35.845 --> 07:38.125
People holding their feelings in for too long

07:38.205 --> 07:40.145
will inevitably lose their rationality

07:40.165 --> 07:41.845
and come up with devious ways

07:42.045 --> 07:44.265
to relieve their emotions.

07:44.285 --> 07:45.725
Do you understand?

07:46.045 --> 07:49.045
We will follow your instructions.

07:52.525 --> 07:54.605
Still, there is one missing.

08:16.045 --> 08:17.385
Your Majesty,

08:17.405 --> 08:18.825
it's windy today.

08:18.845 --> 08:21.285
(Tiande Hall)
Please return to your chamber.

08:23.245 --> 08:25.165
Your Majesty, in your wisdom,

08:25.245 --> 08:27.885
know that Zhang and I are innocent.

08:29.565 --> 08:31.645
Do not penalize us

08:32.925 --> 08:35.625
because of Qi.

08:35.645 --> 08:37.685
The ministers say

08:37.925 --> 08:41.045
he brought disaster to Dazhou.

08:43.285 --> 08:45.205
Then send him away,

08:45.405 --> 08:47.385
(Consort Xian, Yu Qi's birth mother)
away from

08:47.405 --> 08:50.685
the Imperial City and Dazhou.

08:50.805 --> 08:53.805
Qi is the child you carried for ten months.

08:53.885 --> 08:55.685
Can you bear to part with him?

08:56.565 --> 08:59.165
Even if I can't, what can I do?

08:59.525 --> 09:00.645
He was fated

09:00.645 --> 09:03.685
with ill omen from his first breath.

09:07.165 --> 09:09.505
Qi was sent to the South

09:09.525 --> 09:11.925
in swaddling clothes.

09:12.245 --> 09:14.265
Left on the war-torn frontiers

09:14.285 --> 09:16.925
to grow up alone without his parents,

09:17.325 --> 09:19.965
who knows what he's become.

09:20.245 --> 09:22.385
The boy is wayward.

09:22.405 --> 09:25.265
Every time Cui Xu went on an inspection tour,

09:25.285 --> 09:27.685
I sent him to check on him,

09:28.405 --> 09:30.785
but he always avoided meeting him.

09:30.805 --> 09:33.625
He must hold a grudge against me.

09:33.645 --> 09:34.665
Your Majesty,

09:34.685 --> 09:37.145
if you miss the 7th Prince,

09:37.165 --> 09:39.785
why not summon him back to Ling'an?

09:39.805 --> 09:41.245
The Nanwu uprising

09:41.245 --> 09:42.645
that began with his birth

09:42.645 --> 09:44.445
has yet to be quelled.

09:44.645 --> 09:47.525
With the Nightingale Division's shadow

09:47.525 --> 09:50.285
creeping across Dazhou these past years,

09:50.645 --> 09:52.025
his return will make him

09:52.045 --> 09:54.925
the target of public criticism again.

09:55.765 --> 09:57.265
However, Your Majesty,

09:57.285 --> 09:58.525
the 7th Prince

09:58.525 --> 10:00.545
has inherited your valor in battle,

10:00.565 --> 10:01.685
leading the Chiyu Cavalry

10:01.685 --> 10:03.685
to countless victories.

10:03.765 --> 10:05.805
Does this not prove

10:05.805 --> 10:06.925
he is no foe

10:06.925 --> 10:09.045
to the country?

10:09.645 --> 10:11.685
It's not time yet.

10:13.645 --> 10:16.405
I need to think about it.

10:23.645 --> 10:25.005
Chief.

10:26.765 --> 10:28.565
What are you looking at?

10:32.645 --> 10:34.925
Go investigate the Directorate of Astronomy.

10:39.805 --> 10:41.425
Haven't you

10:41.445 --> 10:42.445
been reluctant to look into

10:42.445 --> 10:43.925
what happened back then?

10:44.445 --> 10:46.085
I've changed my mind.

10:47.685 --> 10:49.405
I want to know

10:49.645 --> 10:52.205
who framed me.

10:57.645 --> 10:58.545
Miss Chi,

10:58.565 --> 11:00.765
this is the busiest street in town.

11:01.285 --> 11:02.385
Yes.

11:02.405 --> 11:03.525
Look at this shop, Miss Jiang.

11:03.525 --> 11:04.925
It's been in business for years.

11:04.925 --> 11:05.925
It's very famous.

11:05.925 --> 11:07.925
A snack spot up ahead is famous too.

11:08.125 --> 11:10.005
Miss Chi, how's the location

11:10.005 --> 11:11.445
of this shop?

11:11.685 --> 11:13.745
(Qiaoxiang Shop)
With so many shops around,

11:13.765 --> 11:14.605
opening a shop here

11:14.605 --> 11:16.385
ensures a steady stream of customers.

11:16.405 --> 11:18.025
I think so too.

11:18.045 --> 11:20.645
Once I get the shop up and running,

11:20.645 --> 11:22.625
(Qiaoxiang Shop)
I'll need all hands on deck.

11:22.645 --> 11:23.625
Miss Chi,

11:23.645 --> 11:25.745
I find you smart and resourceful.

11:25.765 --> 11:28.265
Would you consider joining me?

11:28.285 --> 11:29.245
Miss Jiang,

11:29.245 --> 11:30.925
you've already saved me from dire straits.

11:30.925 --> 11:31.925
I don't know

11:31.925 --> 11:33.565
how to repay you.

11:33.685 --> 11:35.985
Now you extend another generous offer,

11:36.005 --> 11:37.145
but I can't be in your debt.

11:37.165 --> 11:39.885
What are your plans then?

11:39.925 --> 11:42.145
I plan to return home

11:42.165 --> 11:44.305
and start a school in the countryside

11:44.325 --> 11:46.325
to teach girls who cannot afford education

11:46.325 --> 11:47.745
literacy and reason.

11:47.765 --> 11:48.925
I'll teach them not to be

11:48.925 --> 11:50.625
as muddle-headed as I used to be.

11:50.645 --> 11:52.805
I hope they will be like you,

11:52.825 --> 11:54.425
who aspire to hearts holding vast horizons

11:54.445 --> 11:55.805
and eyes perceiving greater justice.

11:55.805 --> 11:57.165
I'm flattered.

11:57.565 --> 11:58.745
Miss Chi,

11:58.765 --> 12:01.445
your past sufferings are over.

12:01.685 --> 12:03.285
Every day

12:03.285 --> 12:05.165
will be a new beginning.

12:05.645 --> 12:07.405
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

12:07.795 --> 12:08.645
Take care.

12:08.645 --> 12:13.325
(Qiaoxiang Shop)

12:13.325 --> 12:14.965
Stay safe on the way.

12:21.285 --> 12:22.685
Miss Si.

12:25.315 --> 12:26.205
Take care.

12:26.215 --> 12:27.105
Take care.

12:27.115 --> 12:29.385
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

12:29.385 --> 12:32.115
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

12:32.125 --> 12:33.485
Let's go.

12:34.325 --> 12:36.725
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

12:36.745 --> 12:40.405
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

12:40.425 --> 12:43.845
♪ Growing between us ♪

12:43.995 --> 12:49.515
♪ And breeding love ♪

12:50.335 --> 12:54.015
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

12:54.015 --> 12:58.095
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

12:58.335 --> 13:00.515
♪ Like shadows ♪

13:02.765 --> 13:03.985
Remember,

13:04.005 --> 13:06.145
Heaven helps those who help themselves

13:06.165 --> 13:08.405
and abandons those who abandon themselves.

13:08.415 --> 13:12.615
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

13:12.635 --> 13:14.415
♪ Time glows ♪

13:14.415 --> 13:18.955
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

13:18.975 --> 13:23.255
♪ And stars ♪

13:23.255 --> 13:29.045
(Morning Drizzle)

13:29.045 --> 13:30.555
(Haitang Chamber)

13:30.565 --> 13:31.625
Father.

13:31.645 --> 13:33.045
Si, you're home.

13:33.165 --> 13:34.525
Zhan.

13:36.445 --> 13:37.505
Father,

13:37.525 --> 13:39.285
what are you doing?

13:39.525 --> 13:41.145
Airing out books and paintings?

13:41.165 --> 13:42.625
I heard from your brother

13:42.645 --> 13:44.885
that you want to buy a shop.

13:47.325 --> 13:48.225
Father,

13:48.245 --> 13:49.925
these are your lifelong collections.

13:49.925 --> 13:51.905
How can you just pawn them off?

13:51.925 --> 13:54.405
I'll find a way to buy the shop.

13:54.765 --> 13:57.045
What can an unmarried girl like you

13:57.045 --> 13:58.925
possibly do?

13:58.925 --> 14:00.425
Father, here's my plan.

14:00.445 --> 14:01.405
I will

14:01.405 --> 14:02.445
rent the shop first.

14:02.445 --> 14:04.025
It won't cost much.

14:04.045 --> 14:05.325
Then I'll use

14:05.325 --> 14:06.645
some of my dowry Mother left me,

14:06.645 --> 14:07.785
and that should be enough.

14:07.805 --> 14:09.445
Once the business picks up,

14:09.445 --> 14:10.985
I'll buy the shop.

14:11.005 --> 14:13.385
No renting. Buy it directly.

14:13.405 --> 14:15.165
If my daughter wants to start a business,

14:15.165 --> 14:16.805
shouldn't her father

14:16.805 --> 14:18.165
buy her a shop?

14:18.165 --> 14:21.385
Keep the dowry your mother left you.

14:21.405 --> 14:25.045
You need financial security to stand tall.

14:26.285 --> 14:28.125
Besides, I just

14:28.125 --> 14:29.625
followed rich young lords' trends

14:29.645 --> 14:31.125
when buying these calligraphy works

14:31.125 --> 14:32.425
and paintings.

14:32.445 --> 14:33.925
I haven't

14:33.925 --> 14:36.195
cared for them in years.

14:36.215 --> 14:37.525
Your brother's collections are even more

14:37.525 --> 14:39.205
flashy without substance.

14:39.225 --> 14:41.785
(Haitang Chamber)
He was excited for days

14:41.805 --> 14:43.405
and then threw them in the study

14:43.405 --> 14:44.715
without even looking at them for years.

14:44.715 --> 14:46.545
Look at this dust!

14:46.565 --> 14:47.625
Exactly.

14:47.645 --> 14:48.805
Before buying,

14:48.805 --> 14:50.545
they seemed like rare treasures;

14:50.565 --> 14:52.145
once home,

14:52.165 --> 14:53.625
just some trinkets.

14:53.645 --> 14:56.045
Si, do me a favor.

14:56.045 --> 14:56.925
You know what,

14:56.925 --> 14:59.145
my study is a mess and can barely squeeze in.

14:59.165 --> 15:00.525
Zhan,

15:00.805 --> 15:01.905
Father.

15:01.925 --> 15:04.545
Enough, come help now.

15:04.565 --> 15:06.165
Your brother is clumsy.

15:06.165 --> 15:07.625
If he breaks anything,

15:07.645 --> 15:09.505
we won't get a good price.

15:09.525 --> 15:10.885
Father,

15:11.805 --> 15:13.665
are you really that sure

15:13.685 --> 15:15.545
I can run this shop well?

15:15.565 --> 15:17.265
Of course.

15:17.285 --> 15:18.265
Don't forget

15:18.285 --> 15:21.545
your grandpa was Lingshui's richest man.

15:21.565 --> 15:23.105
Business sense

15:23.125 --> 15:24.325
is an inherited gift

15:24.325 --> 15:26.505
in your bloodline.

15:26.525 --> 15:27.885
Father,

15:28.125 --> 15:30.145
all I do is eat, drink, and be merry.

15:30.165 --> 15:31.125
So my blood of mine

15:31.125 --> 15:32.285
must have come from you, right?

15:32.285 --> 15:33.385
Scram.

15:33.405 --> 15:34.645
Didn't I tell you

15:34.645 --> 15:36.805
I picked you up from somewhere?

15:37.525 --> 15:39.085
Seriously?

15:39.325 --> 15:41.045
No wonder you've been so awful to me.

15:41.165 --> 15:42.565
By the way, Si,

15:42.925 --> 15:44.765
you mustn't let your grandma

15:44.765 --> 15:47.305
find out about your business venture.

15:47.325 --> 15:48.925
Like most Ling'an folk,

15:48.925 --> 15:50.225
she looks down

15:50.245 --> 15:52.545
on merchants,

15:52.565 --> 15:53.765
and would never allow the Earl's

15:53.765 --> 15:55.905
legitimate daughter to engage in trade.

15:55.925 --> 15:57.285
Understood?

15:58.405 --> 15:59.885
I understand.

16:05.125 --> 16:06.105
Father,

16:06.125 --> 16:07.765
see how effective

16:07.765 --> 16:09.385
this Yunxiang Herb is.

16:09.405 --> 16:11.245
The books

16:11.245 --> 16:12.285
show no insect damage

16:12.285 --> 16:13.445
after a full year,

16:13.445 --> 16:14.805
still perfectly intact.

16:15.005 --> 16:17.885
My daughter knows so much.

16:20.285 --> 16:21.505
By the way, Father,

16:21.525 --> 16:23.445
I've rarely heard you mention

16:23.445 --> 16:25.405
the Directorate of Astronomy.

16:25.765 --> 16:26.645
And you seldom associate

16:26.645 --> 16:28.685
with your former colleagues either.

16:29.405 --> 16:31.445
Since your mother's passing,

16:31.645 --> 16:33.645
I've lost the heart for official duties,

16:33.925 --> 16:36.665
so I resigned from my post.

16:36.685 --> 16:38.265
I've always thought

16:38.285 --> 16:39.985
reading the night skies

16:40.005 --> 16:41.565
is mysterious,

16:41.925 --> 16:43.385
predicting weather

16:43.405 --> 16:45.205
and divining fortunes.

16:45.685 --> 16:47.785
While celestial study

16:47.805 --> 16:50.685
holds endless wonders,

16:51.405 --> 16:53.445
the Directorate of Astronomy

16:53.765 --> 16:56.085
is not just about astronomy and geography.

16:56.765 --> 16:58.745
There are more

16:58.765 --> 17:01.165
social climbers

17:01.285 --> 17:03.585
and forced compromises.

17:03.605 --> 17:04.965
Father,

17:06.075 --> 17:07.085
do you recall those copybooks

17:07.085 --> 17:09.705
you kept drilling me on as a child?

17:09.725 --> 17:10.785
Look,

17:10.805 --> 17:13.005
this one slipped through the cracks.

17:13.285 --> 17:15.245
I vividly recall these copybooks.

17:15.405 --> 17:16.245
Back then,

17:16.245 --> 17:17.845
every time I bought one,

17:17.845 --> 17:19.605
it would go missing.

17:19.605 --> 17:21.605
It was strange.

17:22.325 --> 17:23.725
I threw them all away secretly.

17:23.725 --> 17:25.345
I threw a lot away for you.

17:25.365 --> 17:26.325
No wonder your handwriting

17:26.325 --> 17:28.465
is pure chicken scratch.

17:28.485 --> 17:29.325
This isn't for sale.

17:29.325 --> 17:30.505
Drill those strokes.

17:30.525 --> 17:32.125
No, I'll sell this one first.

17:32.125 --> 17:33.285
Ji, hurry up.

17:33.285 --> 17:34.885
- Sell this copybook first!
- Stop there!

17:34.885 --> 17:35.965
You can't sell it.

17:35.965 --> 17:36.885
If you sell it,

17:36.885 --> 17:38.965
you'll face month-long house arrest.

17:38.965 --> 17:39.805
Don't sell it!

17:39.825 --> 17:41.445
Stop right there!

17:46.005 --> 17:47.885
(Fragrance Shop)

17:47.885 --> 17:48.945
Miss,

17:48.965 --> 17:49.845
no one is willing

17:49.845 --> 17:51.585
(Fragrance Shop)
to come and help in our shop.

17:51.605 --> 17:52.965
Ling'an women all balk

17:52.965 --> 17:55.165
at being called businesswomen.

17:55.365 --> 17:56.945
The opening day is looming,

17:56.965 --> 17:58.625
but we're still short of staff.

17:58.645 --> 18:00.125
What should we do?

18:00.965 --> 18:02.365
Miss Chuchu!

18:02.525 --> 18:03.405
Chuchu.

18:03.405 --> 18:04.485
Jiang Zhan told me

18:04.485 --> 18:05.845
you're hiring,

18:06.405 --> 18:07.625
so I brought a candidate.

18:07.645 --> 18:08.725
(Rou'er)
Miss Jiang, how do you do?

18:08.725 --> 18:10.125
Miss Jiang, congratulations

18:10.125 --> 18:11.145
on your new shop's opening.

18:11.165 --> 18:12.645
How do you do?

18:12.765 --> 18:13.605
Chuchu,

18:13.605 --> 18:15.405
you've truly saved me in my hour of need.

18:15.405 --> 18:17.905
Rest assured, Rou'er is definitely reliable.

18:17.925 --> 18:19.045
She's from my hometown,

18:19.045 --> 18:21.405
once a rouge shop owner herself.

18:21.685 --> 18:24.005
Chief, after cracking the case

18:24.005 --> 18:25.365
with His Majesty's backing,

18:25.365 --> 18:27.505
sycophants are eager to curry favor with us.

18:27.525 --> 18:29.485
Mr. Zhao from the Grand Council...

18:29.485 --> 18:30.535
No. I'm busy.

18:30.555 --> 18:31.395
Yes.

18:31.395 --> 18:32.385
Mr. Yu.

18:32.405 --> 18:34.045
- Mr. Jiang.
- What a coincidence.

18:34.205 --> 18:35.405
- Are you rich?
- Come on.

18:35.405 --> 18:36.985
You bought so much stuff.

18:37.005 --> 18:38.345
My sister's fragrance shop

18:38.345 --> 18:39.285
opens the day after tomorrow.

18:39.295 --> 18:40.345
I bought her some opening gifts.

18:40.345 --> 18:41.925
Fragrance shop?

18:42.045 --> 18:43.625
Perfect timing.

18:43.645 --> 18:45.665
I was going to deliver your invitation.

18:45.685 --> 18:47.525
Be sure to come support the opening.

18:47.525 --> 18:49.525
I'm sorry, but he isn't available that day.

18:49.525 --> 18:50.885
I am.

18:51.045 --> 18:52.605
I'll adjust my schedule.

18:52.605 --> 18:53.445
I'll come, definitely.

18:53.445 --> 18:54.585
That's good.

18:54.605 --> 18:55.785
Fragrance Shop?

18:55.805 --> 18:57.685
Good name.

19:07.685 --> 19:09.045
Long Dan!

19:10.605 --> 19:11.965
Long Dan!

19:13.205 --> 19:14.265
What's up, sir?

19:14.285 --> 19:15.705
Where did you put it?

19:15.725 --> 19:16.995
Where did I put what?

19:17.015 --> 19:17.965
Where did you put the thing

19:17.965 --> 19:18.925
I asked you to get?

19:18.925 --> 19:20.745
You didn't ask me to get anything.

19:20.765 --> 19:21.925
Where's my bronze mirror?

19:21.925 --> 19:23.165
Where did you put it?

19:23.165 --> 19:25.165
We don't have a bronze mirror.

19:26.205 --> 19:27.445
Go borrow one from the neighbor.

19:27.445 --> 19:29.405
- Go, go, go!
- I have to...

19:54.725 --> 19:55.645
Chief. Chief.

19:55.645 --> 19:57.185
Mirror, mirror.

19:57.205 --> 19:58.565
The mirror is here.

20:00.245 --> 20:02.165
- Take it easy.
- Here.

20:11.045 --> 20:13.365
Chief, you're dressed like this

20:13.765 --> 20:15.405
to meet Miss Jiang?

20:15.765 --> 20:16.945
What do you think?

20:16.965 --> 20:18.805
With such...

20:21.165 --> 20:22.885
With such striking poise,

20:22.885 --> 20:23.965
you're sure

20:23.965 --> 20:25.645
to impress her.

20:27.925 --> 20:29.645
Haven't I always been like this?

20:30.165 --> 20:31.045
Sure, sure.

20:31.065 --> 20:34.405
Ring the gong, prosper the business.

20:34.605 --> 20:36.605
Grand opening,

20:37.925 --> 20:39.405
great fortune.

20:39.405 --> 20:42.745
Mirror the heart for clarity.

20:42.765 --> 20:45.955
Act with integrity, discipline strictly.

20:50.605 --> 20:52.005
Subtle scents through seasons;

20:52.005 --> 20:54.085
fragrant trails on every journey.

20:54.445 --> 20:55.725
Gourds displayed,

20:55.725 --> 20:57.105
fortune conveyed.

20:57.125 --> 20:59.045
New business, thriving fortunes.

21:00.925 --> 21:02.125
Look how handsome

21:02.125 --> 21:03.005
those gentlemen are.

21:03.005 --> 21:05.465
Mr. Yu, not bad.

21:05.485 --> 21:08.445
You look dashing today.

21:09.245 --> 21:11.805
- Mr. Zhen, thank you for coming.
- Jiang...

21:11.805 --> 21:13.165
Thank you.

21:15.005 --> 21:16.765
Mr. Zhen, don't you always advocate

21:16.765 --> 21:18.965
unwavering duty

21:18.965 --> 21:21.605
and attendance on official leave?

21:22.045 --> 21:23.105
Yes.

21:23.125 --> 21:25.165
But Miss Jiang

21:25.165 --> 21:26.525
personally delivered the invitation

21:26.525 --> 21:28.365
to my door yesterday.

21:28.445 --> 21:29.945
With such an honor,

21:29.965 --> 21:31.185
you know I can't possibly decline.

21:31.205 --> 21:32.505
Thanks a lot.

21:32.525 --> 21:33.885
Really?

21:34.165 --> 21:35.225
Why?

21:35.245 --> 21:36.645
Didn't you receive

21:36.645 --> 21:38.025
Miss Jiang's invitation?

21:38.045 --> 21:39.365
Of course I did.

21:39.365 --> 21:41.325
That's why I'm here.

21:41.805 --> 21:43.125
Before she had the chance to deliver it,

21:43.125 --> 21:45.405
we happened to meet on the road,

21:45.405 --> 21:46.725
so it saved her the trouble

21:46.725 --> 21:48.405
of making a trip.

21:48.725 --> 21:49.745
I see.

21:49.765 --> 21:51.365
What a coincidence.

21:51.685 --> 21:53.845
Chief, didn't you say Jiang Zhan...

21:56.065 --> 21:58.105
Miss Jiang, prepare for the unveiling.

22:00.085 --> 22:01.005
(Fragrance Shop)

22:01.005 --> 22:03.285
Great!

22:03.285 --> 22:05.645
- Great!
- Bravo!

22:08.285 --> 22:12.445
Share fragrance, gather blessings.

22:13.165 --> 22:15.145
Perfect!

22:15.165 --> 22:16.725
Here, one for each.

22:16.725 --> 22:18.345
- It's all inside.
- Take a look inside.

22:18.365 --> 22:19.665
Come in and take a look.

22:19.685 --> 22:21.045
Thanks for coming and supporting us.

22:21.045 --> 22:22.205
Come on inside.

22:22.205 --> 22:23.045
Have a look inside.

22:23.045 --> 22:24.445
- Come on.
- One for each.

22:24.445 --> 22:25.985
Is this yours?

22:26.005 --> 22:27.205
- Thanks.
- Thanks a lot.

22:27.205 --> 22:28.405
Have a look inside, guys.

22:28.405 --> 22:29.785
Come on.

22:29.805 --> 22:31.165
- Si.
- Have a look inside.

22:31.165 --> 22:32.445
- Si.
- Come on in.

22:32.445 --> 22:34.535
Good luck with your business.

22:34.535 --> 22:36.325
(Wealth from all directions)
Come on in.

22:36.365 --> 22:37.705
Thanks, Zhan.

22:37.725 --> 22:39.085
Miss Jiang.

22:39.205 --> 22:41.305
Congratulations on your opening.

22:41.325 --> 22:43.885
(Auspicious opening, customers surge)

22:43.965 --> 22:45.565
Thanks, Mr. Zhen.

22:46.445 --> 22:47.805
Miss Jiang!

22:47.965 --> 22:49.885
May your business thrive and prosper.

22:50.925 --> 22:52.445
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

22:59.605 --> 23:00.885
Today, our opening

23:00.885 --> 23:02.585
is honored by your presence.

23:02.605 --> 23:04.125
We specially prepared 100 red vouchers

23:04.125 --> 23:06.365
to grant you half-price access.

23:06.525 --> 23:08.365
Anyone who spends 20 taels or more

23:08.365 --> 23:09.405
gets a Duck Incense Burner.

23:09.405 --> 23:10.705
Come on in, please.

23:10.725 --> 23:12.405
- That's great.
- Come on.

23:12.725 --> 23:15.185
Jiang Si, this is my congratulatory gift.

23:15.205 --> 23:17.965
Chuchu, you've helped me a lot today

23:17.965 --> 23:19.225
and even got me a gift.

23:19.245 --> 23:20.445
I carved this myself.

23:20.445 --> 23:22.045
It's a talisman, proven powerful.

23:22.045 --> 23:24.005
What a cute little horse!

23:24.045 --> 23:24.925
Little horse!

23:24.925 --> 23:27.085
- Jiang Zhan!
- Did you make this?

23:27.245 --> 23:28.215
Who knew you had

23:28.215 --> 23:29.475
such a hidden skill?

23:29.475 --> 23:30.605
Give it back. It's for Jiang Si.

23:30.605 --> 23:31.685
My sister is busy.

23:31.685 --> 23:32.765
Why don't I keep it for her?

23:32.765 --> 23:34.125
Give it back.

23:34.205 --> 23:35.885
Miss, you're amazing.

23:35.885 --> 23:37.245
Just the scents of monthly perfumes

23:37.245 --> 23:38.925
are enough to pique everyone's curiosity.

23:38.925 --> 23:40.405
This is just the beginning.

23:40.405 --> 23:42.045
When we debut limited-edition perfumes

23:42.045 --> 23:43.165
one after another,

23:43.165 --> 23:44.625
the real game begins.

23:44.645 --> 23:46.445
Ji, Long Dan, come and help!

23:46.445 --> 23:47.645
Coming.

23:47.665 --> 23:48.525
Everyone.

23:48.525 --> 23:49.985
Aman, take it easy.

23:50.005 --> 23:51.965
Miss Jiang, you have affection and faith,

23:51.965 --> 23:53.465
courage and wit.

23:53.485 --> 23:54.485
Independently,

23:54.485 --> 23:56.425
you've opened such a big fragrance shop.

23:56.445 --> 23:58.945
I truly admire you.

23:58.965 --> 24:00.205
I'm flattered, Mr. Zhen.

24:00.205 --> 24:01.145
Miss Jiang,

24:01.165 --> 24:03.025
would you please introduce

24:03.045 --> 24:04.605
these perfumes?

24:05.045 --> 24:06.965
These are gentlemen's perfumes.

24:06.965 --> 24:07.965
For gentlemen's perfumes,

24:07.965 --> 24:08.965
I substituted florals

24:08.965 --> 24:10.885
with mint, cedar,

24:10.885 --> 24:12.365
ebony, and eaglewood,

24:12.365 --> 24:13.725
essences long cherished

24:13.725 --> 24:14.765
by refined scholars,

24:14.765 --> 24:16.765
most befitting your eminences.

24:16.885 --> 24:18.245
Remarkable,

24:18.965 --> 24:20.885
truly remarkable!

24:21.645 --> 24:23.705
Miss Jiang is ingenious

24:23.725 --> 24:25.285
to come up with such a brilliant idea.

24:25.285 --> 24:26.205
Allow me

24:26.205 --> 24:27.625
to introduce the perfumes.

24:27.645 --> 24:29.605
This one is called Autumn Grove,

24:29.605 --> 24:31.525
crafted with citrus, ebony,

24:31.525 --> 24:33.685
amber, and other spices.

24:33.685 --> 24:35.425
Its rich and generous aroma

24:35.445 --> 24:38.165
mirrors modest scholars' unbound spirit,

24:38.165 --> 24:39.505
particularly befitting Mr. Yu.

24:39.525 --> 24:40.365
Mr. Yu,

24:40.365 --> 24:42.805
this bottle of perfume is for you.

24:43.165 --> 24:44.105
Thank you, Miss.

24:44.125 --> 24:45.725
As a mere martial artist,

24:45.725 --> 24:47.125
I don't do perfumes.

24:47.125 --> 24:48.525
Don't waste it.

24:48.925 --> 24:50.785
Then allow me to present another one.

24:50.805 --> 24:51.805
This one is crafted

24:51.805 --> 24:53.505
with ebony, eaglewood,

24:53.525 --> 24:56.245
(Scrolls Slumber)
bergamot, and angelica.

24:56.245 --> 24:57.985
Its calming fragrance

24:58.005 --> 25:00.285
crystallizes the mind.

25:00.285 --> 25:02.265
It's called Scrolls Slumber.

25:02.285 --> 25:03.205
Mr. Zhen,

25:03.205 --> 25:04.985
this one suits you very well.

25:05.005 --> 25:06.605
Please accept it.

25:06.885 --> 25:08.445
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

25:12.165 --> 25:13.425
Scrolls Slumber.

25:13.445 --> 25:15.145
What a good name.

25:15.165 --> 25:16.285
Looks like

25:16.285 --> 25:18.085
you know me well.

25:18.485 --> 25:19.845
Let me see.

25:20.805 --> 25:22.705
It's a good name, indeed.

25:22.725 --> 25:24.125
I never had the habit of using perfume,

25:24.125 --> 25:26.345
but your words convinced me.

25:26.365 --> 25:28.165
(Autumn Grove)
I might as well try both.

25:29.245 --> 25:30.585
Perfect.

25:30.605 --> 25:31.445
Unbelievable.

25:31.445 --> 25:33.045
Miss,

25:33.365 --> 25:34.725
the perfumes over there are sold out.

25:34.725 --> 25:35.805
I need to get some more.

25:35.805 --> 25:37.425
All sold out?

25:37.445 --> 25:38.605
Ok, go get more.

25:38.605 --> 25:39.965
Yes.

25:42.405 --> 25:43.285
Take a whiff.

25:43.285 --> 25:44.245
Do you feel

25:44.245 --> 25:46.705
the gallop across endless grasslands,

25:46.725 --> 25:48.045
wind roaring

25:48.045 --> 25:50.005
past your ears?

25:50.125 --> 25:51.485
So many perfumes.

25:51.485 --> 25:53.365
Can you remember all their names?

25:53.685 --> 25:55.525
This is Wanderer's Odyssey.

25:55.525 --> 25:58.125
Unfettered grace and swift reckonings.

25:58.525 --> 26:00.605
That sounds perfect for me.

26:04.725 --> 26:06.565
I think this one suits you better.

26:06.965 --> 26:07.885
What's this?

26:07.885 --> 26:10.045
Warm Sun.

26:10.205 --> 26:11.645
It suits you.

26:15.925 --> 26:17.285
I am

26:18.165 --> 26:19.845
the warm sun?

26:22.325 --> 26:25.845
(Haitang Chamber)

26:28.725 --> 26:30.165
Si.

26:31.045 --> 26:32.265
Si.

26:32.285 --> 26:33.645
Father,

26:34.605 --> 26:36.005
you're here.

26:36.445 --> 26:37.605
First day of business.

26:37.605 --> 26:39.085
Tired?

26:42.365 --> 26:44.595
Looks like you're doing well.

26:44.615 --> 26:46.775
Your grin is splitting your face.

26:46.795 --> 26:48.815
Father, you're making fun of me again.

26:48.835 --> 26:51.005
Look what I brought you.

26:51.685 --> 26:53.085
What?

26:57.005 --> 26:58.365
Milk Cakes!

26:58.885 --> 27:00.325
There's more.

27:00.365 --> 27:01.885
Spring tea.

27:01.965 --> 27:03.605
Father knows me best.

27:03.605 --> 27:05.385
Spring tea paired with Milk Cakes,

27:05.405 --> 27:08.285
- ultimate treat of Ling'an.
- Ultimate treat of Ling'an.

27:11.965 --> 27:13.525
Tasty.

27:14.605 --> 27:16.105
Si,

27:16.125 --> 27:19.145
I didn't give you enough care.

27:19.165 --> 27:20.685
Now you have to

27:20.685 --> 27:22.425
hold up this family alone.

27:22.445 --> 27:23.925
It's too much for you.

27:23.945 --> 27:26.335
Father, now I'm doing

27:26.355 --> 27:27.605
all the things I like.

27:27.605 --> 27:28.645
I'm happy.

27:28.645 --> 27:29.985
I know.

27:30.005 --> 27:32.405
My daughter is the most capable.

27:32.405 --> 27:33.765
That's right.

27:34.965 --> 27:36.325
By the way,

27:36.405 --> 27:37.965
I was going to tell you

27:37.965 --> 27:39.505
a few words,

27:39.525 --> 27:40.725
but seeing that you were busy,

27:40.725 --> 27:42.865
I never got the chance to say them.

27:42.885 --> 27:44.605
What is it, Father?

27:45.925 --> 27:47.845
What do you think

27:47.925 --> 27:49.565
about your second sister?

27:50.445 --> 27:52.325
She has been ill-fated in love.

27:52.645 --> 27:54.525
Luck hasn't been on her side.

27:58.725 --> 27:59.885
We can't control

27:59.885 --> 28:01.605
our luck,

28:02.205 --> 28:03.965
but when

28:03.965 --> 28:06.165
misfortune strikes,

28:06.205 --> 28:09.745
we can still choose wisely.

28:09.765 --> 28:12.265
If your future husband treats you badly,

28:12.285 --> 28:13.765
never mind whatever the impact

28:13.765 --> 28:16.145
it may have on your in-laws or us,

28:16.165 --> 28:18.405
come home at once.

28:19.985 --> 28:21.605
Yes, Father.

28:22.885 --> 28:24.605
But I don't want to

28:24.725 --> 28:27.085
get married yet.

28:27.765 --> 28:29.845
Don't marry unless you're ready.

28:30.245 --> 28:32.085
I'm not pushing you.

28:32.205 --> 28:33.645
Life is too long

28:33.645 --> 28:36.685
for a half-hearted union.

28:37.125 --> 28:38.425
You know,

28:38.445 --> 28:41.445
finding someone who truly stirs your soul

28:41.445 --> 28:43.325
is rare magic.

28:43.525 --> 28:45.165
I want my daughter

28:45.165 --> 28:47.125
to meet such a man.

28:47.205 --> 28:48.565
Of course,

28:48.725 --> 28:50.205
he must feel the same

28:50.205 --> 28:51.745
for my daughter.

28:51.765 --> 28:54.365
Otherwise, I won't give my consent.

28:56.205 --> 28:59.405
Your daughter asks for nothing more.

28:59.445 --> 29:01.985
There is

29:02.005 --> 29:03.425
no greater happiness

29:03.445 --> 29:05.145
than living a peaceful life

29:05.165 --> 29:06.885
with my father and brother.

29:07.725 --> 29:09.965
Having the whole family together

29:09.965 --> 29:11.845
is better than anything else.

29:13.205 --> 29:14.765
These are your favorites.

29:14.765 --> 29:16.125
Sit down.

29:18.205 --> 29:19.585
Thank you, Mother.

29:19.605 --> 29:21.225
You're the best cook.

29:21.245 --> 29:22.605
(Mrs. Zhen)

29:22.605 --> 29:23.865
Heng,

29:23.885 --> 29:24.805
you keep

29:24.805 --> 29:26.505
skipping meals.

29:26.525 --> 29:27.885
I think you've

29:27.885 --> 29:29.685
lost weight again lately.

29:30.205 --> 29:33.265
The caseload has been crushing lately.

29:33.285 --> 29:34.285
Once I'm done with it,

29:34.285 --> 29:35.485
everything will be fine.

29:35.485 --> 29:37.065
I mean it's about time

29:37.085 --> 29:38.285
you get a wife

29:38.285 --> 29:39.605
to remind you to eat regularly.

29:39.605 --> 29:40.965
Don't bother.

29:41.085 --> 29:42.225
Look at my days,

29:42.245 --> 29:43.845
swamped with official duties.

29:43.845 --> 29:44.805
My time has

29:44.805 --> 29:46.165
stretched thin already.

29:50.245 --> 29:52.485
Register of Brides-to-Be.

29:53.805 --> 29:54.805
I realize that your ability

29:54.805 --> 29:56.265
to gather information

29:56.285 --> 29:58.425
is almost as good as ours.

29:58.445 --> 29:59.505
You know what,

29:59.525 --> 30:01.085
I paid a lot of money for this

30:01.085 --> 30:02.805
at the Matchmaker's Hall.

30:02.805 --> 30:04.865
Since you paid so much money,

30:04.885 --> 30:05.805
I will

30:05.805 --> 30:07.965
read it carefully later.

30:09.045 --> 30:10.205
I don't believe you.

30:10.205 --> 30:11.685
Read it now.

30:12.485 --> 30:14.185
Whichever girl you're interested in,

30:14.205 --> 30:16.445
leave it to me.

30:18.885 --> 30:23.405
(Fragrance Shop)

30:28.885 --> 30:32.365
(Jade Bloom Aroma)

30:32.565 --> 30:33.745
I'll take this one.

30:33.765 --> 30:35.605
Ok, here you are.

30:36.045 --> 30:37.525
Here, take a look.

30:39.045 --> 30:40.285
Rou'er, here.

30:40.285 --> 30:41.585
- Ok.
- Have a cup of tea.

30:41.605 --> 30:42.965
Take a break.

30:43.195 --> 30:44.045
Miss, have some tea.

30:44.045 --> 30:44.945
Chuchu.

30:44.965 --> 30:46.325
Come here.

30:46.445 --> 30:47.785
You've been busy today.

30:47.805 --> 30:49.245
Have some tea.

30:49.365 --> 30:50.725
This tea smells good.

30:51.085 --> 30:52.545
It's jasmine tea.

30:52.565 --> 30:54.065
How is it today?

30:54.085 --> 30:54.965
Jiang Si,

30:54.965 --> 30:55.845
you know what,

30:55.845 --> 30:57.605
your perfumes are amazing.

30:57.805 --> 30:59.285
Every perfume here

30:59.285 --> 31:00.325
transports me

31:00.325 --> 31:02.265
to a different world.

31:02.285 --> 31:03.485
When I paint the visions in my mind

31:03.485 --> 31:04.485
for our customers,

31:04.485 --> 31:06.445
they reach for their wallets every time.

31:06.525 --> 31:08.405
Fragrance Shop?

31:09.765 --> 31:10.965
I've never seen you

31:10.965 --> 31:12.685
use these before.

31:15.325 --> 31:16.925
Well,

31:17.245 --> 31:18.245
a new fragrance shop

31:18.245 --> 31:20.025
opened in town lately.

31:20.045 --> 31:21.005
I went there to take a look.

31:21.005 --> 31:21.965
The shopkeeper said

31:21.965 --> 31:25.585
this perfume can refresh my mind,

31:25.605 --> 31:27.005
so I bought it to try.

31:27.005 --> 31:28.325
Scrolls Slumber?

31:28.325 --> 31:30.485
To refresh your mind?

31:31.045 --> 31:34.605
I could be mistaken, probably.

31:39.125 --> 31:40.425
Tell me.

31:40.445 --> 31:42.225
Who did you buy this for?

31:42.245 --> 31:43.785
I bought it for myself.

31:43.805 --> 31:45.445
Which girl?

31:46.045 --> 31:47.405
Mother,

31:47.525 --> 31:48.965
it doesn't involve any girl.

31:48.965 --> 31:50.525
I know my son best.

31:50.525 --> 31:51.485
How dare I lie to you?

31:51.485 --> 31:53.365
If you don't tell me, I'll be angry.

32:00.005 --> 32:02.365
Fine, it's Jiang Si,

32:02.525 --> 32:06.165
fourth daughter of Earl Dongping's household.

32:06.565 --> 32:08.985
We just know each other.

32:09.005 --> 32:10.225
That's all.

32:10.245 --> 32:11.505
She is the owner

32:11.525 --> 32:12.595
of Fragrance Shop.

32:12.615 --> 32:13.965
(The same Jiang Si who set the city abuzz)

32:13.965 --> 32:16.525
(by breaking her engagement?)

32:16.645 --> 32:18.965
(Fragrance Shop)

32:20.005 --> 32:21.925
Fragrance Shop.

32:27.965 --> 32:29.105
While other shops

32:29.125 --> 32:31.045
deploy pretty girls

32:31.045 --> 32:32.665
to coax customers,

32:32.685 --> 32:33.525
we neither

32:33.525 --> 32:35.785
coax nor grovel.

32:35.805 --> 32:37.865
It will help us to earn gentlemen's respect.

32:37.885 --> 32:39.205
Then, they'll be more convinced

32:39.205 --> 32:41.205
by the visions you paint.

32:44.245 --> 32:45.345
Miss,

32:45.365 --> 32:47.835
could you recommend some fragrances?

32:47.855 --> 32:48.865
Chuchu,

32:48.885 --> 32:50.525
I'll do it. You take a break.

32:55.485 --> 32:58.165
What kind of fragrance would you like?

32:58.365 --> 32:59.465
Used for gifts.

32:59.485 --> 33:01.825
My niece

33:01.845 --> 33:03.105
is visiting soon.

33:03.125 --> 33:06.025
I'll prepare two welcome gifts for her.

33:06.045 --> 33:07.285
She is

33:07.285 --> 33:08.665
about your age.

33:08.685 --> 33:10.725
Allow me to recommend some to you.

33:10.845 --> 33:12.945
You can try this one first.

33:12.965 --> 33:15.025
This is Angelica Balm.

33:15.045 --> 33:16.045
Apply it

33:16.045 --> 33:17.845
to your wrists and behind your ears.

33:17.845 --> 33:19.005
As your body warmth activates it,

33:19.005 --> 33:20.365
the fragrance will diffuse

33:20.365 --> 33:22.005
through your garments.

33:25.445 --> 33:27.445
It's elegant.

33:27.805 --> 33:30.685
Do you have any other aromas?

33:32.085 --> 33:34.185
You can try this one too.

33:34.205 --> 33:35.205
This balm

33:35.205 --> 33:37.105
is crafted with lychee rind

33:37.125 --> 33:38.985
blended into fruit notes.

33:39.005 --> 33:41.005
It's always raining

33:41.005 --> 33:42.685
this time of year in Ling'an.

33:52.605 --> 33:55.205
(Fragrance)

34:04.485 --> 34:06.325
Fresh and elegant.

34:06.925 --> 34:08.585
Thank you for your recommendation.

34:08.605 --> 34:10.725
I'll take both.

34:10.965 --> 34:12.585
Would you like to see more?

34:12.605 --> 34:14.445
I will come again.

34:14.485 --> 34:15.925
Thank you, Ma'am.

34:20.885 --> 34:22.365
Ma'am.

34:24.565 --> 34:26.085
Please wait.

34:26.485 --> 34:27.865
Ma'am,

34:27.885 --> 34:29.765
(Fragrance Shop)
you forgot your wallet.

34:30.285 --> 34:31.965
I'm so forgetful.

34:31.965 --> 34:33.205
Thank you, Miss.

34:33.205 --> 34:34.265
You're welcome.

34:34.285 --> 34:37.125
You're a beautiful girl with a kind heart.

34:37.285 --> 34:39.085
I'm flattered, Ma'am.

34:41.805 --> 34:43.685
Qi, what are you doing here?

34:43.685 --> 34:44.805
Why don't you get in?

34:44.805 --> 34:46.125
Why is Mrs. Zhen here?

34:46.125 --> 34:47.765
Mr. Zhen's mother?

34:49.205 --> 34:50.625
It's her.

34:50.645 --> 34:51.645
No wonder

34:51.645 --> 34:52.605
she seems to

34:52.605 --> 34:53.965
like Jiang Si very much.

34:53.965 --> 34:55.245
She dismissed others' recommendations

34:55.245 --> 34:56.245
without a glance,

34:56.245 --> 34:57.705
yet listened carefully

34:57.725 --> 34:59.525
to Jiang Si's every word.

34:59.645 --> 35:02.065
I get the sense she's not here for perfumes.

35:02.085 --> 35:04.265
Instead, she seems to come to see Jiang Si.

35:04.285 --> 35:06.425
Qi, do you think

35:06.445 --> 35:07.625
she is here to check out

35:07.645 --> 35:09.845
a potential daughter-in-law?

35:10.325 --> 35:11.425
No way.

35:11.445 --> 35:13.045
Definitely not.

35:13.325 --> 35:15.045
Take care, Ma'am.

35:15.765 --> 35:17.725
Come back again.

35:27.725 --> 35:29.285
Mr. Yu!

35:30.725 --> 35:32.105
Miss Jiang, you're here.

35:32.125 --> 35:34.005
What are you doing here, Mr. Yu?

35:34.245 --> 35:35.985
Are you going on a case?

35:36.005 --> 35:38.125
No, I was just passing by

35:38.485 --> 35:39.845
and brought some food for my sister.

35:39.845 --> 35:41.305
I, this...

35:41.325 --> 35:42.685
Go ahead.

35:42.965 --> 35:44.245
Wash it before eating.

35:44.245 --> 35:45.585
I've washed it.

35:45.605 --> 35:46.725
Wash it well.

35:46.745 --> 35:48.105
I...

35:49.285 --> 35:51.005
How careless she is!

35:51.245 --> 35:52.385
Mr. Yu,

35:52.405 --> 35:54.065
as a martial artist,

35:54.085 --> 35:55.845
do you wear Autumn Grove too?

35:56.885 --> 36:00.005
Martial artists love Autumn.

36:00.805 --> 36:02.405
It's summer.

36:05.685 --> 36:07.605
Mr. Yu, wait a minute.

36:13.165 --> 36:15.125
(Invitation)

36:20.285 --> 36:21.445
I was planning

36:21.445 --> 36:23.185
to visit your residence today.

36:23.205 --> 36:25.285
My grandma's birthday is coming soon.

36:25.285 --> 36:26.765
On behalf of Earl Dongping's Mansion,

36:26.765 --> 36:28.005
I cordially invite you

36:28.005 --> 36:29.585
to attend her celebration banquet.

36:29.605 --> 36:30.645
Thank you, Mr. Yu,

36:30.645 --> 36:32.565
for all your previous assistance.

36:33.285 --> 36:35.925
Ok, I'll be there.

36:52.365 --> 36:53.725
Wait.

36:57.885 --> 36:58.725
Sit down, honey.

36:58.725 --> 37:00.085
Thank you, darling.

37:02.165 --> 37:03.665
What would you like to drink?

37:03.685 --> 37:05.085
It's scorching today.

37:05.085 --> 37:06.185
Get us some cold tea, will you?

37:06.205 --> 37:07.625
- Yes.
- Wait.

37:07.645 --> 37:09.565
No cold drinks for her cold constitution.

37:09.845 --> 37:11.645
Floral tea would be better.

37:11.965 --> 37:13.325
That's her favorite.

37:13.365 --> 37:14.725
Yes.

37:16.325 --> 37:21.365
(Zhu Ziyu, Jiang Yi's husband)

37:23.005 --> 37:24.305
Look at you, all sweaty.

37:24.325 --> 37:25.785
You don't always have to indulge me.

37:25.805 --> 37:27.165
No worries.

37:28.085 --> 37:29.585
The journey must have

37:29.605 --> 37:30.985
worn you out, darling.

37:31.005 --> 37:32.485
Visiting your parents' home is a rare joy,

37:32.485 --> 37:33.885
no hardship at all.

37:36.285 --> 37:38.365
Because your safety and happiness

37:38.965 --> 37:40.865
are my greatest wish.

37:40.885 --> 37:42.565
Here's your tea!

37:45.725 --> 37:47.085
Thank you.

37:48.165 --> 37:49.525
Enjoy your tea.

37:59.565 --> 38:00.905
By the way,

38:00.925 --> 38:03.625
tomorrow is your grandma's birthday.

38:03.645 --> 38:05.285
When you see your elder sister,

38:05.285 --> 38:06.985
talk to her.

38:07.005 --> 38:07.845
Ask her

38:07.855 --> 38:09.545
how she's been getting along lately.

38:09.565 --> 38:10.665
Yes, Father.

38:10.685 --> 38:12.285
I miss her too.

38:12.725 --> 38:14.125
I've failed

38:14.125 --> 38:16.805
your eldest sister.

38:17.285 --> 38:19.185
When she was born,

38:19.205 --> 38:20.785
I was young and my world

38:20.805 --> 38:23.525
revolved around your mother.

38:23.565 --> 38:25.285
I had little

38:25.285 --> 38:26.925
left for her.

38:27.605 --> 38:29.785
She has been nothing

38:29.805 --> 38:31.705
but thoughtful and capable

38:31.725 --> 38:34.645
and never demanded more than I could give.

38:35.285 --> 38:36.385
Thankfully,

38:36.405 --> 38:37.925
she married well.

38:38.085 --> 38:39.565
Her husband

38:39.565 --> 38:40.565
is good-natured

38:40.565 --> 38:42.245
who treasures her.

38:42.485 --> 38:44.765
Don't worry, Father.

38:44.845 --> 38:46.485
She is so kind-hearted.

38:46.605 --> 38:48.325
She will surely lead a good life.

38:50.285 --> 38:52.385
All right, I'm leaving.

38:52.405 --> 38:53.925
Take care, Father.

39:05.205 --> 39:08.725
(Capital Security Office)

39:08.725 --> 39:10.925
Mother, why are you here?

39:11.325 --> 39:12.185
Heng,

39:12.205 --> 39:14.365
I brought you a new gown.

39:15.005 --> 39:16.585
What's the occasion?

39:16.605 --> 39:17.805
I hear today is the birthday

39:17.805 --> 39:20.585
of the old lady of Earl Dongping's Mansion.

39:20.605 --> 39:21.925
You'll go with me

39:21.925 --> 39:23.405
to pay our respects.

39:23.805 --> 39:25.205
Oh?

39:25.845 --> 39:28.345
You have a great eye.

39:28.365 --> 39:30.185
I also like the fourth young lady

39:30.205 --> 39:31.765
of the family.

39:34.165 --> 39:35.525
Mother,

39:35.925 --> 39:37.845
since when did you know her?

39:38.005 --> 39:39.445
Enough dilly-dallying.

39:39.445 --> 39:40.645
Go try it on.

39:40.645 --> 39:41.485
Quickly.

39:41.485 --> 39:46.765
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)

39:46.805 --> 39:47.645
Miss,

39:47.655 --> 39:49.465
what's the hurry to get to the main hall?

39:49.485 --> 39:50.765
Today is Grandma's birthday banquet,

39:50.765 --> 39:52.225
and Mother is busy making arrangements.

39:52.245 --> 39:53.945
I must do a good job

39:53.965 --> 39:55.125
so that Mother

39:55.125 --> 39:56.565
will stop being mad at me

39:56.565 --> 39:57.865
over what happened to Qian

39:57.885 --> 39:58.925
and focus on arranging me

39:58.925 --> 40:00.145
a good marriage.

40:00.165 --> 40:01.625
Miss, you're quick-witted as always.

40:01.645 --> 40:02.585
Right?

40:02.605 --> 40:04.245
- Hurry up.
- Yes.

40:06.605 --> 40:08.125
Watch out, Miss.

40:16.485 --> 40:18.965
Miss, are you all right?

40:22.085 --> 40:24.445
Are you Mr. Zhen?

40:24.765 --> 40:26.125
Yes, I am.

40:26.285 --> 40:28.925
What a pretty young lady.

40:29.685 --> 40:30.645
We're here

40:30.645 --> 40:32.745
to celebrate Mrs. Jiang's birthday.

40:32.765 --> 40:33.845
Grandma should be

40:33.845 --> 40:35.565
in the backyard right now.

40:36.325 --> 40:38.005
Are you her granddaughter?

40:38.245 --> 40:40.865
You're beautiful and kind-hearted.

40:40.885 --> 40:42.725
I'm flattered, Mrs. Zhen.

40:42.885 --> 40:44.145
Mr. Zhen,

40:44.165 --> 40:46.925
may I show you the way?

40:51.405 --> 40:53.405
Thank you, Miss.

40:54.565 --> 40:55.925
This way, please.

41:00.845 --> 41:02.985
Why hasn't Yi come yet?

41:03.005 --> 41:04.765
Is her husband preventing her from coming?

41:04.765 --> 41:06.745
We haven't seen her in ages.

41:06.765 --> 41:08.385
Today is Grandma's birthday.

41:08.405 --> 41:10.205
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)
She must come.

41:10.205 --> 41:11.905
The Zhu Family has no reason to stop her.

41:11.925 --> 41:12.765
Exactly.

41:12.765 --> 41:14.545
Lingshui is a long way from Ling'an.

41:14.565 --> 41:16.605
Let's wait a little longer.

41:23.485 --> 41:25.605
Si, Zhan.

41:25.805 --> 41:27.165
Yi.

41:40.885 --> 41:42.265
It's Yi.

41:42.285 --> 41:43.645
Yi.

41:44.605 --> 41:46.045
Yi.

41:47.085 --> 41:48.445
Si.

41:55.005 --> 41:56.405
Yi.

42:00.765 --> 42:02.205
Yi!

42:08.725 --> 42:10.725
(It's good to see her)

42:11.165 --> 42:12.525
(again.)

42:13.005 --> 42:14.565
You must have suffered.

42:18.765 --> 42:19.805
Last time when you

42:19.805 --> 42:20.905
broke off your engagement,

42:20.925 --> 42:22.705
I couldn't make it back to support you.

42:22.725 --> 42:24.065
It's all my fault.

42:24.085 --> 42:26.445
You don't blame me, right?

42:27.245 --> 42:28.645
It's ok, Yi.

42:29.805 --> 42:31.485
I just miss you so much.

42:31.565 --> 42:32.905
I miss you too.

42:32.925 --> 42:34.765
I'm always worried you're not doing well.

42:34.805 --> 42:36.485
But seeing that

42:36.765 --> 42:37.945
you look great,

42:37.965 --> 42:39.485
I can finally feel at ease.

42:39.925 --> 42:41.745
You two are so close.

42:41.765 --> 42:43.265
Yi always talks about you at home.

42:43.285 --> 42:45.245
Before coming back for Grandma's birthday,

42:45.265 --> 42:46.245
she started preparing gifts

42:46.245 --> 42:47.845
half a month in advance.

42:49.125 --> 42:53.405
(The End of Episode 8)

42:53.895 --> 42:55.625
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.625 --> 43:00.565
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.935 --> 43:03.315
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.315 --> 43:07.545
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.255 --> 43:10.655
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.675 --> 43:14.335
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.355 --> 43:17.775
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.925 --> 43:23.445
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.265 --> 43:27.945
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.945 --> 43:32.025
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.265 --> 43:34.005
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.025 --> 43:38.725
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.725 --> 43:42.295
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.315 --> 43:46.545
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.565 --> 43:48.345
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.345 --> 43:52.885
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.905 --> 43:57.705
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.935 --> 44:04.465
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.485 --> 44:08.105
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.125 --> 44:11.555
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.575 --> 44:16.195
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.195 --> 44:19.885
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.905 --> 44:23.995
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.105 --> 44:25.925
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.925 --> 44:30.475
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.495 --> 44:34.195
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.215 --> 44:38.375
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.555 --> 44:40.315
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.315 --> 44:44.835
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.835 --> 44:48.475
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.495 --> 44:54.165
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.855 --> 44:57.785
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.785 --> 45:05.285
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
